    "body": "How about we rename _inherited origin_ above to just _origin_ and overwrite it here when the url's scheme is \"data\"? And then below we just return _origin_. That way we don't store an opaque origin redundantly in most scenarios and also reduce the number of variables that don't use camel case at the same time. ",
